==Overview ==
This unit is one of the only units that changes its appearance completely when you upgrade it. This was added in the [[Episode 77 Part 1 Update]].

You can obtain it by summoning it from [[Basic Crate|Basic]] & [[Mythic Crate]], [[Trading]], or getting it from [[Post Office]].

== Appearance ==
The toilet seems to have a head of the [[DJ Toilet]] from the series and it has purple headphones, with a beanie. It seems to have three spider legs each equipped with lots of armory. It also seems to have its own turntable with more speakers and blasters on each end.

