== Trivia ==

* This unit can solo every gamemode. (Except for [[Abysmal Mode (The Void)|The Void]] and [[Endless Mode]].)
* For some reason, his max level form is a combination of the DJ Toilet 3.0 and the DJ Toilet 2.0, due to the 3.0 version's body being attached to the strider legs the 2.0 version uses.

